OL,3,GNEWSAThief stole #48k and Rolex watches
OL,4,Afrom family home after tracking their
OL,5,Asocial media posts
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man planned a burglary on a family
OL,8,Fhome after seeing social media posts
OL,9,Fthat they would be out at a Chinese New
OL,10,FYear celebration, stealing #48,000 in
OL,11,Fcash, two Rolex watches and multiple
OL,12,Fitems of sentimental value.
OL,14,FShane Davies, from Neath, was given an
OL,15,F18-month jail sentence, suspended for
OL,16,Ftwo years, after admitting the burglary
OL,17,Fof the property in Llangyfelach,
OL,18,FSwansea, on 18 February.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
