OL,3,GNEWSAThief stole #48k and Rolex watches
OL,4,Afrom family home after tracking their
OL,5,Asocial media posts
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family used social media to
OL,8,Fadvertise a celebration they were
OL,9,Fholding at a Chinese restaurant they
OL,10,Fowned in Swansea, coming home to find a
OL,11,Fwindow had been forced open and the
OL,12,Fitems stolen.
OL,14,FDavies was arrested four days later,
OL,15,Fwith police finding screenshots of the
OL,16,Ffamily's social media posts on his
OL,17,Fphone.
